Your mere presence is terrying to any foes that dare stand against you.

Every turn all foes in radius [2, 5, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] must make a mental save against your spellpower/physical power (whichever is highest) or become frightened (bypassing fear immunity), reducing all their saves by [10, 21, 28, 35, 40 (TL1-5)], all damage by [10%, 16%, 19%, 23%, 25% (TL1-5)] and movement speed by [8%, 16%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5)].

If they successfully resist, they are immune for [19, 15, 13, 12, 11 (TL1-5)] turns.
